nostrc — Debian source package
==============================

This is a `3.0 (native)` package for the phase-1 internal PPA (decision
D-13). Upstream lives at https://github.com/chebizarro/nostrc and the
archive-NEW upload will switch to `3.0 (quilt)` once the packaging
metadata (symbols files, watch file accuracy, upstream signature key)
is complete.

Only the headless nostr-login stack is packaged from this source in
phase 1; the GObject / GTK / desktop-app layers will follow in later
phases as separate binary packages from the same source.
